  "notes": "Scoped to the Chrome 159 WebTransportOptions.datagramsReadableType option, the resulting default vs byte-stream mode on WebTransportDatagramDuplexStream.readable, and the pullDatagrams BYOB view validation and empty-datagram rules. Surrounding base WebTransport and WebTransportDatagramDuplexStream members (createWritable, maxDatagramSize, incomingMaxAge, outgoingMaxAge, incomingMaxBufferedDatagrams, outgoingMaxBufferedDatagrams, allowPooling, requireUnreliable, serverCertificateHashes, protocols, headers) pre-existed Chrome 159 and are documented on MDN and earlier gendn entries."
